  "prompt": "Create a running voxel horse in godot",
  "final_prompt": "Create a running voxel horse in godot\n\nBuild this as a complete, playable Godot 4.7.2 project in the current directory.\n- Use the gl_compatibility renderer, and don't enable thread support (it must run as a web export).\n- Set a main scene in project.godot. Add a short README.md with run instructions.\n- Keep it self-contained: no downloads, external assets or plugins.\n- Only create or edit files inside the current directory. Don't export the project; that happens afterwards.\n- Check it loads: run `godot --headless --path . --editor --quit` and fix any errors.\n- Finish with a short summary of what you built.\n",
